    "labeling_note": "The existing profiler manifest has no dedicated synthetic-scenario label. Bob's profile.name explicitly says fictional synthetic example; Alice's existing read-only profile name does not. Keep generated histories separate under their approved output paths and identify them with this contract path, selected profile path, and seed. Do not merge them with golden rows or change receipt IDs or the four-field identity hash.",
    "identity_limit": "The native ReceiptEntity uses receipt_id as its primary key. Each fixture row therefore has a unique receipt_id; no repeated-ID multi-line grouping or portable receipt-to-ledger mapping is modeled."
  },
